/// calls it.
///
/// \return The string `file_gtt_dot`.
///
/// \see ProfileCmdInterface::AddResultFunction


/// \fn void ProfileResultFileGTT::Delete(void)
/// \brief Destroys the writer and frees its memory with ProfileFreeMemory.
///
/// \warning Name not confirmed; see ProfileResultFileGTT.
///
/// ProfileCmdInterface::RunResultFunctions calls it right after
/// ProfileResultFileGTT::WriteResults. The class has no destructor of its
/// own, so neither the copied names nor the visited-edge list is freed.
/// Retail BFME 2 shares one body among all three writers' Delete functions.
///
/// \see ProfileResultFileDOT::Delete, ProfileResultFileCSV::Delete
